    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition": [
      {
        "@value": "Amalgamated, shore-parallel sand bodies incorporating BEACH, coastal dunes (DUNE - foredune BGU-sT), WASHOVER and backbarrier FLAT deposits. May comprise multiple shorelines to form a PLAIN (STRAND- or CHENIER) (modified from Griffin et al., 2012).",
